 P("Complete the following by selecting the correct option from the brackets: A delayed monsoon increases the __________ of farmers. (profits / risk) (Paragraph 2)", 1, "risk"),
 P("Select the option that is TRUE according to Paragraph 3.", 1, "When harvests are good, markets become busy.", ["Food prices rise when harvests are good.", "When harvests are good, markets become busy.", "Only farmers follow rainfall reports.", "The government imports more grain after good harvests."], 'b'),
 P("Complete the analogy by selecting the correct option.<br>Satellite : Weather forecast :: Drip irrigation : ______", 1, "Saving water.", ["Saving water", "Flooding fields"], 'a'),
