 P("What are the main ideas of Paragraph 3 and Paragraph 5?<br>i. Rainfall affects the whole economy, not only farms.<br>ii. Farmers can reduce the risk of poor rains by adopting new measures.<br>iii. The government should stop importing grain.<br>iv. The monsoon is always harmful.<br>v. Mobile phones are costly.", 1, "Paragraph 3 — i; Paragraph 5 — ii.", None, 'c', table(["Option", "Main idea of Paragraph 3", "Main idea of Paragraph 5"], [["A", "iii", "iv"], ["B", "ii", "i"], ["C", "i", "ii"], ["D", "iv", "v"]])),
